  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, combine the water (for the couscous) and vegetable stock pot and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977de6326cd47f1a599ea/step-dde80f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve snacking tomatoes. Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook chickpeas, stirring occasionally, until softened, 2-3 minutes. Add garlic & herb seasoning and tomato paste and cook, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in the water (for the chickpeas) and simmer, until slightly reduced, 1 minute. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977de6326cd47f1a599ea/step-1c27fe10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine snacking tomatoes, mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977de6326cd47f1a599ea/step-bb70ac20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous and cherry tomato salad between bowls. Top couscous with herby tomato chickpeas.\n• Crumble over marinated goat cheese. Sprinkle over flaked almonds. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681977de6326cd47f1a599ea/step-f8c73f30.jpg"
    }
  ]
